Luxury 3-Bedroom Apartment at Horizon Sand – 50 meters from Forte Novo Beach, Quarteira

Discover this elegant 3-bedroom apartment, located in the exclusive Horizon Sand complex in Forte Novo, one of Quarteira’s most sought-after areas, just 50 meters from the beach.

Set within a newly built private condominium, completed in 2025, this resale apartment is move-in ready, combining high-quality finishes, generous living spaces, and a truly prime seaside location.

The property features:

• Spacious and bright living room with direct access to the balcony;

• A modern, open-concept kitchen, fully equipped and featuring a breakfast bar;

• Pantry;

• 3 bedrooms, all en suite, with built-in closets;

• Guest bathroom;

• 2 parking spaces in the garage;

• Private storage room.

The condominium features a communal pool, garden, and meticulously maintained outdoor areas, providing a peaceful and exclusive atmosphere.

The location is one of this property’s major highlights: just 50 meters from Forte Novo Beach, right next to the boardwalk, and within walking distance of restaurants, shops, and services.

An excellent option for a permanent residence, vacation home, or investment, offering the perfect balance between comfort, quality, proximity to the beach, and the convenience of having all amenities nearby.

A unique opportunity to live by the sea in a modern, move-in-ready apartment.
